        "params": {
          "text": "Three-sample delay\nRun 2 s at 1000 Hz; open the time scopes, then Frequency response → Analyze captured impulse.\nMagnitude stays 1; unwrapped phase falls linearly to −540° at Nyquist.\nPulse area = 1; inspect input and output separately so the pulse does not hide the response.",
